  "prefLabel": "Puc 202.04 Commission technical session",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 202.04 “Commission technical session” means a meeting of the parties at which information is shared on an informal basis and, with notice, the presiding officer, commissioners, or commission staff are present pursuant to RSA 541-A:31,V(b).\n\nSource. #14184, eff 1-24-25",
